{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55609","headline":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 七 · 延寿","name":"永明山居诗（六十九首） 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"事多兴废莫持论，唯有禅宗理可尊。\n似讷始平分别路，如愚方塞是非门。\n刳肠只爲生灵智，剖舌多因强语言。\n争似息机高卧客，年来年去道长存。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"延寿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55609.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55609","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}